  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"font-size:23pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Мод Sea Eater</span></h1>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Испытайте ужасы глубин! 🌊👹</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Мод для Minecraft Java Edition на NeoForge, добавляющий в ваш мир огромных и пугающих морских существ и их экипировку. Встречайте легендарных монстров глубоководья и создавайте мощное снаряжение из их чешуи!</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Особенности</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"font-size:16.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">🌊 Четыре огромных морских существа</span></h3>\n<h4 style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Sea Eater (Враждебный босс)</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Здоровье:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 1000 ОЗ (500 сердец)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Урон:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 50 урона за удар</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Размер:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Абсолютно гигантский (60x150 блоков)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Место обитания:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Очень глубокие океаны (ни