=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Место обитания:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Очень глубокие океаны (ниже Y=53)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Спавн:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Чрезвычайно редкий (1%)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Добыча:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 3-5 чешуек El Gran Majá</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Особенности:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;backgrou