ily:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Гигантский серый кит (масштаб x8)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Место обитания:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Вблизи поверхности океана (выше Y=40)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Спавн:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Необычный (10%)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Добыча:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 15 чешуек Bloop</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Особенности:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Дружелюбный гигант с чёрными глазами сверху, огромный открытый чёрный рот</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Bloop (Враждебный)</span></h4>\n\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Здоровье:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 800 ед. здоровья (400 сердец)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Урон:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 15 ед. урона за удар</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee