kground-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Меч:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 2 чешуйки + 1 палка</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Шлем:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 5 чешуек</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Нагрудник:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 8 чешуек</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Поножи:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 7 чешуек</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Ботинки:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 4 чешуйки</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Советы</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Поиск боссов:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Sea Eater и El Gran Majá появляются в самых глубоких частях океанов. Погружайтесь глубже!</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Поиск Bloops:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Оба Bloop появляются у поверхности океана. Плавайте вокруг, чтобы встретить их!</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Бой:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Все существа имеют минимальное отбрасывание, что позволяет сражаться в ближнем бою</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Снаряжение:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Экипировка Sea Eater самая мощная, но экипировка Bloop легче добывается</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Известные особенности</span></h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Sea Eater создаёт эффектную последовательность смерти с тряской экрана</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Sea Eater и El Gran Majá территориальны и сражаются друг с другом</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Все существа погибают при выходе из воды</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#d8dee9;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Яйца призывания доступны в творческом режиме для тестирования</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Авторы</span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Автор:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> Simon &amp; Steve Ostrowski</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Версия:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 1.0.0</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Версия Minecraft:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> 1.21.1</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\">Загрузчик модов:</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none\"> NeoForge 21.1.52</span></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"line-height:1.5\"><span style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Лицензия</span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000\">Все права защищены</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38\"><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
